7,Orokolo Language (ORO) – L1 & L2 Speakers... | Ethnologue Free,https://www.ethnologue.com/language/oro/,"Orokolo is a stable indigenous language of Papua New Guinea. It belongs to the Trans-New Guinea language family. Direct evidence is lacking, but the language is thought to be used as a first language by all in the ethnic community.",Orokolo,Trans-New Guinea
