9,Trans New Guinea [Newguineaworld],https://newguineaworld.linguistik.uzh.ch/families/trans-new-guinea/start,"Trans New Guinea. Timothy Usher, Santa Fe Institute.Awaiting the conclusion of lexical comparison between its reconstructed subfamilies, the most compelling evidence for Trans-New Guinea is the formal resemblances between the personal pronouns of its members.",Orokolo,Trans-New Guinea
